---
<Layout title={post.title} description={post.description}>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(articleSchema)} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(localBusinessSchema)} />
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-8 pt-16 pb-24">
    <header class="mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="bg-primary/20 text-primary font-label font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded-full">{post.category}</span>
        <time class="font-body text-sm text-secondary">{post.date}</time>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-headline text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tighter text-on-surface mb-4">{post.title}</h1>
      <p class="font-body text-lg text-secondary leading-relaxed">{post.description}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <section class="mb-12">
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Malaysia's pet industry is one of the quiet growth stories of the last decade. Independent vet clinics now stock more SKUs than ever — prescription diets, supplements, dental chews, flea treatments — and pet stores in Cheras, Bangsar, and Subang are running mini e-commerce arms next to their retail floor. All of that needs reliable packaging. The wrong carton damages bags, leaks vitamin powder onto delivery vehicle floors, or arrives at a customer's door looking unprofessional. Quinocycle has been supplying Klang Valley pet retailers and clinics from our Balakong factory since 2010 — here's what we've learnt about getting pet-supply packaging right.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Pet Food Cartons That Won't Burst</h2>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Dry Food in 5kg, 10kg & 20kg Outers</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Dry kibble is heavier than it looks once you stack four bags into a single shipping carton. We see retailers under-spec their boxes, then write off RM 30–50 per damaged delivery. Our 5-ply double-wall outers handle 25kg per box without bowing, and the right inner dimensions stop bags shifting in transit — which is what splits the seams.</p>

        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Wet Food, Pâtés & Pouch Multipacks</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Cans and pouches need water-resistant outers — a leaked pouch on the bottom layer ruins everything above it. We line our wet-food cartons with a moisture-resistant kraft and recommend an inner divider for cans to stop denting at the courier hub.</p>

        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Treats, Dental Chews & Topper SKUs</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Smaller, lighter SKUs travel best in right-sized cartons that minimise empty space. Loose treat bags inside an oversized box arrive crushed at the bottom corner. Sizing to 80–90% fill rate cuts both damage and dimensional weight charges.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Vet Clinic Workflow Boxes</h2>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Prescription Refill Outers</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Vet clinics doing prescription delivery (Apoquel, Cytopoint, NSAIDs, joint supplements) need clean, branded outers that signal professionalism. We supply small-format white kraft cartons with optional 1-colour print for clinic logo and dosing instructions.</p>

        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Surgical & Lab Supply Restock</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Heavier, double-wall cartons are used for the inbound side — sutures, vials, gloves, instruments arriving from distributors. Many clinics reuse these cartons for outbound deliveries, which is fine for grooming-supply orders but not for prescription refills where appearance matters.</p>

        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Cold Chain Vaccine Outers</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Vaccines and biologics ship in insulated outer cartons sized to fit a gel-pack and a vaccine pouch. We supply the outer cartons; clinics source the gel packs separately. Food-grade lining keeps moisture from condensation off the carton walls.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Aquarium, Bird & Small-Animal Supplies</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Aquarium retailers ship glass tanks, filters, gravel, and fragile décor — a category that benefits from heavy-duty outers plus internal corrugated dividers. Bird and small-animal suppliers (rabbit pellets, hamster bedding, cuttlefish bones) lean on lighter single-wall cartons because the SKUs are bulky but light. Right-sizing matters most here, since couriers charge on dimensional weight.</p>
      </section>

      <div class="bg-surface-variant/50 border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-8 my-12">
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Pet-Industry Carton Spec Cheat Sheet</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">DRY KIBBLE OUTER (15kg)</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">5-ply double-wall | 450x300x250mm</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">WET FOOD MULTIPACK</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">3-ply, water-resistant | 350x250x150mm</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">VET PRESCRIPTION REFILL</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">Single-wall white | 200x150x100mm</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">AQUARIUM ACCESSORY</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">5-ply + dividers | 400x300x300mm</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Pet-Industry FAQs</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Are your carton boxes food-grade enough for pet food?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes — our virgin kraft liner meets the same hygiene benchmarks as human-food packaging. For loose dry food we recommend an inner liner; sealed bags, cans, and pouches go straight into the carton.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">What box strength do I need for 15kg dog food bags?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">5-ply double-wall is the safe default for 15–20kg single-bag outers. Single-wall 3-ply is fine for 5kg bags or treat-only orders.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Do you supply small quantities for independent vet clinics?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes, as long as your order hits the RM 1,000 minimum. Most clinics combine cartons, bubble wrap, tape, and labels into a single drop.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Can boxes be printed with my pet store branding?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes — 1–4 colour flexo print available from 1,000 cartons upward. Allow 7–10 working days from artwork sign-off.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Do you deliver to vet clinics across Klang Valley?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes — Cheras, Kajang, Seri Kembangan, Subang, PJ, central KL all covered. WhatsApp for delivery timing in your area.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12 bg-primary/5 border border-primary/20 rounded-lg p-8">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Wholesale Pet-Supply Packaging from Balakong</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Whether you run a single Cheras clinic or distribute pet food across Peninsular Malaysia, Quinocycle stocks the cartons you need at wholesale rates. Same-week dispatch from our Balakong factory.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface mb-6"><strong>Contact Quinocycle today:</strong></p>
        <ul class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm space-y-2 mb-6">
          <li>📞 <strong>Phone:</strong> +60 16 8916 381 / 03-8962 6381</li>
          <li>📧 <strong>Email:</strong> quinocycle@gmail.com</li>
          <li>📍 <strong>Address:</strong> No.13, Jalan Taming P/1, Taming Jaya, Balakong, Selangor 43300</li>
        </ul>
        <a href={WA_LINK} class="inline-block bg-primary text-on-primary font-label font-bold text-sm px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">💬 Chat on WhatsApp</a>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Conclusion: Packaging Built for the Pet Aisle</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-4">Pet supplies are a deceptively demanding category — heavy bags, leak-prone wet food, fragile aquarium gear, and prescription items where appearance matters. Right-spec cartons protect both your margin and your brand.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">Talk to Quinocycle about your pet-supply packaging. We've supplied Klang Valley clinics and stores since 2010 and we know the SKUs.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
